@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 Decorated class expressions as a statement, an initializer, a call argument, a member object and a superclass (tests/format/js/decorators/class-expression/class-expression.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 The same fixtures with semi false, where a statement starts with a decorated class expression (tests/format/js/decorators/class-expression/jsfmt.spec.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 A decorated class expression whose decorator has bit-shift-like type arguments, with babel-ts (tests/format/typescript/type-arguments-bit-shift-left-like/4.ts) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Parenthesize every class expression that has decorators (src/language-js/needs-parens.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Print the decorators and the class on indented lines inside the parentheses, with the semicolon before them in no-semi mode (src/language-js/printer-estree.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Add the changelog entry (changelog_unreleased/javascript/12260.md)
